{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男星周渝民（仔仔）近期喜事連連，不僅與言承旭、吳建豪攜手五月天阿信展開《F✦FOREVER恆星之城》演唱會引爆話題，個人更憑藉台劇《我們與惡的距離Ⅱ》強勢入圍第61屆金鐘獎「戲劇節目男主角獎」。</p><p>除了演藝事業再度迎來巔峰，他與愛妻喻虹淵結</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T20:19:37.107532+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:01:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:17:55.425255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T20:17:55.425255+00:00","content_hash":"d98cee023107760f263abecc8bf6a828e16f37d767c3d3206568e26d6a3e4c83","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}